@startuml
title D5 — Technical Consultant Implementation Lifecycle
caption From business need to configured, tested, deployed and supported Surefyre solution

left to right direction

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam wrapWidth 200
skinparam maxMessageSize 110
skinparam nodesep 55
skinparam ranksep 75
skinparam padding 16

skinparam rectangle {
  RoundCorner 14
  BorderThickness 1.4
}

rectangle "1. Discovery\n\n• Stakeholders\n• Current process\n• Pain points\n• Business goals" as Discovery #EAF2FF

rectangle "2. Solution Design\n\n• Future workflow\n• Forms and rules\n• Roles and access\n• Integration needs" as Design #F3F8E8

rectangle "3. Configuration\n\n• Form builder\n• JSON schema\n• JavaScript behavior\n• Workflow and calculations" as Configure #FFF4CC

rectangle "4. Integration and Migration\n\n• REST / SOAP\n• Field mapping\n• Authentication\n• Python import/export scripts" as Integrate #FFF1DF

rectangle "5. Testing and UAT\n\n• Functional\n• Negative\n• Integration\n• Regression\n• Business acceptance" as Test #F1ECFA

rectangle "6. Deployment Readiness\n\n• Production settings\n• Permissions\n• Endpoints\n• Documentation\n• Support plan" as Deploy #EAF4EA

rectangle "7. Go-Live and Stabilization\n\n• Smoke tests\n• Issue reproduction\n• Defect correction\n• User support" as Stabilize #EAF2FF

rectangle "8. Continuous Improvement\n\n• Enhancements\n• Reusable patterns\n• Product feedback\n• Best practices" as Improve #F3F8E8

Discovery -right-> Design
Design -right-> Configure
Configure -right-> Integrate
Integrate -right-> Test
Test -right-> Deploy
Deploy -right-> Stabilize
Stabilize -right-> Improve

Improve -[dashed]left-> Discovery : New program,\nchange or enhancement

legend bottom
|= Phase |= Technical Consultant focus |
| Discovery | Understand the customer, users, process and business problem |
| Solution Design | Translate business needs into a configuration approach |
| Configuration | Build forms, rules, workflows, calculations and instance changes |
| Integration and Migration | Connect systems and prepare or transform data |
| Testing and UAT | Validate behavior and support business acceptance |
| Deployment Readiness | Prepare production configuration, documentation and support |
| Go-Live and Stabilization | Verify production, reproduce issues and correct defects |
| Continuous Improvement | Reuse patterns, recommend changes and improve the product |
endlegend

@enduml
